---
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <p class="footer-note">
      This website is still being rebuilt. I am moving from an older
      Jekyll setup that became a bit painful to maintain, so some pages, links, and formatting are
      still being cleaned up as I migrate everything into this new version.
    </p>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} - PhD Student, <a href="https://mila.quebec" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mila</a> &amp; <a href="https://www.umontreal.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Université de Montréal</a>
    </p>
    <p class="footer-colophon">
      Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a> · © {year}
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
